            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-checklist",
        "moduleId": "troubleshoot-and-completion",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "exercise",
        "title": "小检查：定位两处错误",
        "markdown": "假设 `/tmp/py` 下有一个文件，内容如下，但运行时报错：\n\n```python\n Print(\"hello world\")\n```\n\n请对照上面两条排查提示，指出最可能的两个问题。\n\n参考要点：内置函数名是 `print` 而不是 `Print`，大小写不一致；同时该行开头多了一个空格，在顶层代码中会造成缩进错误。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-run-commands",
            "textbook-error-checklist"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "bridge-next",
